# Everything in the repo root is uploaded as the public site EXCEPT what is listed here (the app is served from "./").
# Patterns follow .gitignore syntax. This list covers today's repo (index.html, protocol.js, manifest, icon, README, serve.ps1)
# and the planned layout (app/, worker/, migrations/, test/, docs/, scripts/, CI and tooling files).
# Served on purpose: index.html, protocol.js, app/, sw.js, icons, manifest.webmanifest. `_headers` is read by Cloudflare as
# configuration. When you add a new PRIVATE file or folder at the top level, add it here.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
.vercelignore
.assetsignore
.env*
.dev.vars*
.wrangler
node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json
wrangler.jsonc
wrangler.toml
worker
migrations
test
docs
scripts
CLAUDE.md
README.md
*.ps1
